<title>USA: ArgentBank to buy Assumption Bank &amp; Trust.</title>
<headline>ArgentBank to buy Assumption Bank &amp; Trust.</headline>
<dateline>THIBODAUX, La. 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ArgentBank said Friday it is in talks to buy Assumption Bank &amp; Trust Co company for about $21.5 million or about $134 per share.</p>
<p>ArgentBank said it would pay in cash and common stock.</p>
<p>Assumption has total assets of about $107 million and operates two branches in Assumption Parish and one motor branch in La Place, Louisiana.</p>
</text>
